From 79c926fb48fa65145ba39f8ceda9b61d55a571c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:01:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix quiz choices rendering as "[object Object]"

Choices can arrive as objects like { "id": "A", "text": "5 + 5i" }, and
String() on those produced the literal text "[object Object]".

- add src/lib/textValue.ts (toText, choiceId, choiceLabel,
  stripChoiceLabel, resolveChoiceIndex)
- use toText() instead of String() in MathText, parseQuestions,
  gradeExercise, parentTracking, the admin editor loader, the AI
  generate/explain routes and the public exercise route
- add ChoiceText component rendering "A. text"; use it on the student
  quiz page and the admin preview
- add scripts/test-choices.mjs and register it in package.json

No changes to correct answers, Khmer text, math notation, answer
selection or scoring.
